    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17745" root="زعب" body-key="z">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِزْدَعَبْتُ الشَّىْءَ</span></b>  <i>I carried the thing; took it
up and carried it;</i> or <i>carried it off</i> or <i>away;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمَلْتُهُ</span>: you say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَّ بِهِ فَٱزْدَعَبَهُ</span> [<i>He passed by
it and carried it off</i> or <i>away</i>]. (S.) [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازدغب</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 1, in three places.

